==================== Small documents for WARPSTAT.REXX ===================

INSTALLING:
===========


Just add it as an AREXX pfile in for instance systext:sys.welcome as:

 {#0pfiles:WARPSTAT.REXX}
 ^
 `-----> [<CTRL>Q]

There is NO keypress routine in the script, so if you want to have a PAUSE
then place this after the line above: \G0
                                      ^
           [<CTRL>Y]------------------'

The script is compiled for faster reading, editing the script will
mess up the script and make it unreadable ( eh, GAMER :) )

Editing the script and altering it is PROHIBITED. 
  It is (c)opyleft '95 WARP GROUP


WHY A KEYFILE:
==============

I just like to have foreign mail :) ... Edit the reg form and send it to
one of my addresses listed inside the form.


Mail your postcard to:   Nico van Royen
